  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math><br /><br />Put <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, we get<br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>On taking Sigma on both sides</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>2</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>4</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>3</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>5</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>4</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>n</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>n</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>n</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>n</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Again taking&nbsp;Sigma on both the sides&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>10</mn></munderover><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>n</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>10</mn></munderover><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>10</mn></munderover><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>n</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>.</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>21</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>.</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>10</mn></munderover><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>n</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>330</mn></math>.</p>"
